EDP - Experiment 3

Preparing a Business Model Canvas for a Startup Idea.
Write Aim, Objective, Introduction, Conclusion as per your choice, but in Main content answer these following questions regarding your own Business idea generated in Experiment 1.

1. Customer Segments 
Who are your customers?




2. Value Proposition 
What problem are you solving?




3. Channels 
How will you reach your customers?




4. Customer Relationships 
How will you interact with customers?




5. Revenue Streams

How will your startup earn money?



6. Key Resources 
What do you need to run the business?




7. Key Activities 
What activities must your startup perform?




8. Key Partners 
Who will help your startup?




9. Cost Structure 
What will you spend money on?
